Package: LymphoSeq2
Title: Analyze High-Throughput Sequencing of T and B Cell Receptors
Version: 2.0.0
Authors@R:
    c(
    person("Wu", "Elena", email = "ewu2@fredhutch.org", role = "aut"),
    person("Ravishankar", "Shashidhar", email = "shashidhar.r.shankar@gmail.com ", role = c("cre", "aut")),
    person("Coffey", "David", role = c("aut")))
Description: Analyze high-throughput sequencing of T and B cell receptor
    complementarity determining region 3 (CDR3) sequences. Supports multiple
    platforms including Adaptive Biotechnologies ImmunoSEQ, 10X Genomics
    single-cell VDJ sequencing, BGI-IRSeq, and MiXCR processed data. Provides
    tools for diversity analysis, clonality metrics, gene usage visualization,
    and repertoire comparison.
